Subject: [PATCH] Aurora: cheaper HD look effects (opt-in) (RecompCore #54, as merged)

RecompCore #54 as it was merged into the 0.13.0 batch (codex/0.13.0-batch 595a9bda65), in one patch:
its 13 commits, with this batch's conflict resolution where there was one (the merge's message).

- b48524af2c Aurora: cloud shadows from a baked noise texture (opt-in)
- c00b3399da Aurora: ambient occlusion keeps its distance beside it (opt-in)
- cfc02a90e0 Aurora: full-size effects skip pixels they leave unchanged (opt-in)
- 066e3327ac Revert "Aurora: full-size effects skip pixels they leave unchanged (opt-in)"
- e70a1f9192 Aurora: DOL_AURORA_FAR_NO_SKY_PROBE, a diagnostic for the far blur's sky check
- c9f7f44ab1 Aurora: the full-size effects share one render pass (opt-in)
- 7823296252 Revert "Aurora: the full-size effects share one render pass (opt-in)"
- 90fb1b6ed4 Aurora: optionally batch frame staging copies
- 0354f721d7 Aurora: test staging copy ordering
- 85f2c3ea01 Revert RecompCore #53's staging-copy batching (retest)
- 58567c1420 Aurora: in-between frames reuse the real frame's soft blurs (opt-in)
- dc09a4fb2a Revert "Aurora: in-between frames reuse the real frame's soft blurs (opt-in)"
- 740132cb99 Revert "Aurora: DOL_AURORA_FAR_NO_SKY_PROBE, a diagnostic for the far blur's sky check"
